{"id":"H8092","lemma":"שִׁמְעָא","transliteration":"shimah, shima","sayIt":"shim-ah,-shim-a","language":"Hebrew","partOfSpeech":"","gloss":"Shimea","meaning":"A man of the tribe of Levi living at the time of Divided Monarchy, only mentioned at 1Ch.6.30;\nson of: Uzzah (H5798B);\nfather of: Haggiah (H2293)\n§ Shimea = \"fame\"\n1) son of David by Bathsheba\n2) brother of David, the 3rd son of Jesse\n2a) also 'Shammah', 'Shimma', and 'Shimeah'\n3) a Gershonite Levite, father of Berachiah, and grandfather of Asaph\n4) a Merarite Levite, son of Uzzah, and father of Haggiah","glosses":["shimea","shimei"],"count":5,"occurrences":[{"chapterId":"1ch-2","v":13,"renderings":{"bsb":"Shimea","kjv":"and Shimma"}},{"chapterId":"1ch-3","v":5,"renderings":{"bsb":"Shimea","kjv":"Shimea"}},{"chapterId":"1ch-6","v":30,"renderings":{"bsb":"Shimea","kjv":"Shimea"}},{"chapterId":"1ch-6","v":39,"renderings":{"bsb":"of Shimea","kjv":"of Shimea"}},{"chapterId":"1ch-20","v":7,"renderings":{"bsb":"Shimei","kjv":"of Shimea"}}],"elsewhere":[{"ref":"1 Chronicles 2:13","note":"and Jesse became the father of his firstborn Eliab, and Abinadab the second, and Shimea the third,","source":"web"}],"related":[{"id":"H8051","lemma":"שַׁמּוּעַ","transliteration":"shammua","gloss":"Shammua"},{"id":"H1732","lemma":"דָּוִד","transliteration":"david","gloss":"David"},{"id":"H8093","lemma":"שִׁמְעָה","transliteration":"shimah","gloss":"Shimeah"},{"id":"H0467","lemma":"אֲלִיפֶ֫לֶט","transliteration":"eliphelet","gloss":"Eliphelet"},{"id":"H1296","lemma":"בֶּרֶכְיָה","transliteration":"berekhyah","gloss":"Berechiah"},{"id":"H2293","lemma":"חַגִּיָּה","transliteration":"chaggiyyah","gloss":"Haggiah"},{"id":"H4317","lemma":"מִיכָאֵל","transliteration":"mikhael","gloss":"Michael"},{"id":"H5798","lemma":"עֻזָּא","transliteration":"uzza","gloss":"Uzzah"}],"senses":[{"id":"H8092H","gloss":"Shimea","relation":"H8092H ="},{"id":"H8092I","gloss":"Shimea","relation":"H8092I = a Name of"},{"id":"H8092J","gloss":"Shimea","r